00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:03.980
Four...
Four...

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:04.950
Three...
Three...

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:05.980
Two...
Two...

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:06.980
One...
One...

00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:07.920
Zero!
Zero!

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:20.400
We did it!

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:24.870
T-This can't be...

00:02:25.670 --> 00:02:29.480
All of my hard work and planning
was destroyed by just two girls?

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:35.440
An Unjustified Lover's Grudge
Let Me Love You Without Revenge

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:46.730
"Hermaphroditos lies asleep
in a bush surrounded by flowers."

00:02:46.730 --> 00:02:51.430
"As he lies deep in the grass,
his face wet with tears,"

00:02:51.430 --> 00:02:53.640
"the full moon reveals itself
from between the clouds."

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:57.830
"Its gentle glow shines down,
lovingly caressing the young man's face."

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:01.200
Let's stop here today, Meshuzera.

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:08.240
It's getting a little windy.

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:12.480
Still, I love the night breeze.

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:14.650
It makes the stars sparkle brighter.

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:18.130
Even then, the starry night sky
is especially beautiful tonight.

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:24.360
If only I had the hands of the gods, I'd take hold
of the stars and sprinkle them onto your hair.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:29.670
No, I shouldn't do that.

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:34.070
If you became any more beautiful,
it would likely stir the gods to anger.

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:42.050
I love you, Meshuzera.

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:47.910
Master Reamonn, dinner is ready.

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:49.650
Ah, thanks.

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:10.040
Jeez, I hate persistent men.

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:12.010
I bet he has a thing for us.

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:13.980
Being popular isn't always easy.

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:16.410
We'll be shot down at this rate!

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:20.280
I'd wish he'd win us over
with sweet words instead.

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:41.500
Well done!

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:43.940
Shoot! We're out of fuel!

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:45.780
Uh-oh!
Uh-oh!

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:51.580
Here we go.

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:16.950
What's the matter, Meshuzera?

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:18.170
You don't seem like yourself today...

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:26.550
Meshuzera!

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:30.260
Meshuzera!

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:33.720
Meshuzera!

00:05:47.710 --> 00:05:52.580
The client, Lore Reamonn, wants you
to find out who killed his dearly beloved.

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:54.570
That's the purpose of this mission.

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:56.280
His dearly beloved?

00:05:56.280 --> 00:05:57.910
Was she his fiancée, or something?

00:05:58.050 --> 00:06:03.960
Well, not exactly, but he certainly did love her.

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:07.800
As part of this request
to carry out his revenge,

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:12.290
Reamonn has expressed that
he wants to kill the culprits himself.

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:15.330
What? So basically, we're
helping him avenge his woman?

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:17.340
So, who was she?

00:06:21.340 --> 00:06:24.080
She's pretty, but don't you think
she's wearing a bit too much powder?

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:26.850
You dummy, it's a doll.

00:06:26.850 --> 00:06:28.680
Please explain, Chief.

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:33.290
Truth is, Reamonn is a rather strange man.

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:35.760
He detests real women.

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:39.560
The only woman he was ever able to love
was a statue he made himself.

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:42.700
That statue, which he called
Meshuzera, was very dear to him.

00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:45.030
Does he have some kind of mental illness?

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:47.800
That's none of our concern.

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:51.410
The murderers Reamonn is searching for...

00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:56.340
...dropped an unmanned pod over
Aria Island around 10 PM, two days ago.

00:06:56.340 --> 00:06:57.870
All you need to do is find them.

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:00.980
W-What did you just say?

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:07.220
An unmanned pod fell on the Reamonn mansion
and destroyed Meshuzera. It happened...

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:08.520
...two days ago...

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:09.390
...at 10 PM...

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:09.860
Huh? Do you know something?
...at 10 PM...

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:12.220
Huh? Do you know something?

00:07:12.430 --> 00:07:13.500
N-No!
N-No!

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:15.830
So what type of pod was it?

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:17.660
An RC-11 type.

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:34.180
Kei, what are we going to do?
We're the ones he's after.

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:39.390
There's no point in getting worked up about it.
We just have to do our best, like real women.

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:40.790
That's all there is to it.

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:44.030
Do you have some kind of plan, by chance?

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:45.120
Yep.

00:07:46.030 --> 00:07:49.330
Really, there's only one thing we can do.

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:54.990
Turn ourselves in and apologize.

00:07:56.270 --> 00:07:57.340
No way!

00:07:57.340 --> 00:08:00.010
The guy is some kind of crazy weirdo.

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:04.550
He'd kill us! Torture us slowly, too...

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:07.520
Burn us at the stake, use water torture,
even wooden-horse torture...

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:09.810
No, I absolutely will not!

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:14.520
Okay then, let's decide with a game of
rock-paper-scissors. Loser takes the blame.

00:08:14.520 --> 00:08:16.820
No! That's such a guy thing to do.

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:21.060
I adore myself. After all, I am adorable.

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:24.170
You're just hateful, so I bet you hate yourself.

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:25.790
How about you go surrender?

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:27.670
There she goes, throwing a hissy-fit.

00:08:27.670 --> 00:08:32.800
She's impossible to deal with when she gets
like this. I suppose I ought to calm her down...

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:36.040
You know, if you think
about it, it's his fault, too.

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:38.850
It's unhealthy that he can only
love a woman made out of plaster.

00:08:38.850 --> 00:08:40.350
He's nothing but a social reject!

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:44.590
That's it! All we need to do
is make him cancel the request!

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:44.850
Oh, you're right!
That's it! All we need to do
is make him cancel the request!

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:45.650
Oh, you're right!

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:49.520
Instead of a cold statue, we'll teach him
to appreciate the warmth of a real woman.

00:08:50.760 --> 00:08:55.300
We'll make Reamonn forget
his love for Meshuzera!

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:58.700
Yeah! This sounds like it
might actually be a fun job.

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:02.570
Step by step, let's teach him
the ABCs between a man and a woman!

00:09:02.570 --> 00:09:05.070
Plus, he wasn't that bad-looking either!

00:09:05.070 --> 00:09:07.470
Well, there we have different tastes, but...

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:10.050
Don't you think this is the perfect job for us?

00:09:10.050 --> 00:09:11.310
Yeah!

00:09:12.350 --> 00:09:17.550
Just you wait. I'll show you how superior
I am as a woman, compared to you.

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:22.020
"Perfect job for us"?
You wish. It's perfect for me.

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:35.070
Meshuzera, my love serves
as a bridge between us.

00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:38.640
Even though you've left this world for
that unknown land beyond the valley of death,

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:41.200
our bridge of love is everlasting.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:51.010
Master Reamonn.

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:55.410
W-Who are those women?!

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:59.060
Sir, they're the 3WA Trouble Consultants-

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:00.430
I'm Yuri!

00:10:04.430 --> 00:10:05.400
I'm Kei.

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:08.340
I should also point out that my chest
is three centimeters bigger than Yuri's.

00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:12.670
What do you think you're doing?

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:14.110
Same to you!

00:10:14.180 --> 00:10:15.110
Ahem.

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:22.280
Master Reamonn!

00:10:22.280 --> 00:10:24.580
It-It's all right. I just feel dizzy.

00:10:26.090 --> 00:10:27.580
Pull yourself together, Reamonn!

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:29.280
You mustn't go near him!

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:30.620
Huh?

00:10:38.230 --> 00:10:42.860
Master Reamonn is allergic to women.
If a woman comes within a meter of him...

00:11:09.930 --> 00:11:12.700
Lord Giloss, we've located the target!

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:36.850
Th-This is terrible.

00:11:37.530 --> 00:11:39.320
It must have been a
harrowing experience for you.

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:44.260
Every time I set foot into this room,
I'm haunted by Meshuzera's shadow,

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:48.430
and my love for her tears me apart.

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:50.370
I understand how you must feel.

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:54.610
If I could, I'd heal your wounded
heart while lying down beside you.

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:57.480
What a shameless girl!

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:01.440
Be strong.

00:12:03.020 --> 00:12:04.420
It's all right.

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:06.980
Please stay back!
You mustn't go near him.

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:10.890
Do you understand?

00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:14.760
But this was an accident.

00:12:14.760 --> 00:12:18.030
I doubt they did it on purpose.

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:20.640
It doesn't matter if they meant it or not!

00:12:20.640 --> 00:12:24.800
I swore to myself that I would
avenge Meshuzera with my own hands!

00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:28.010
My, how wonderful! So passionate.

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:28.940
No!

00:12:33.780 --> 00:12:37.220
Sh-Sh-She touched me!

00:12:59.570 --> 00:13:02.010
W-What's gotten into him?

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:05.150
Master Reamonn has an idiosyncrasy.
If he's touched by a woman,

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:07.720
an impulse in his cerebral cortex releases
agarno fluid into his bloodstream,

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:11.590
which turns the glucose
in his body into alcohol.

00:13:11.590 --> 00:13:14.560
As a result, he becomes drunk.

00:13:36.140 --> 00:13:37.270
Where am I?

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:39.470
What did I do?

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:41.680
You're all right now.

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:43.150
I'm sorry...

00:13:43.150 --> 00:13:44.520
If only I had been more careful...

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:47.150
I see. I had another one of
my allergic fits, didn't I?

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:49.520
Curse the gods.

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:55.760
Why did they give me this illness?

00:13:56.300 --> 00:13:58.490
Poor Master Reamonn.

00:13:58.670 --> 00:14:00.800
Miralda, I'm sorry for
all the trouble I cause you.

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:02.540
My, not at all.

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:09.170
Your father was a dedicated butler and worked
hard for me, but your dedication exceeds his.

00:14:09.610 --> 00:14:15.670
I'm just grateful that you let me work for you
despite your female allergy, Master Reamonn.

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:18.510
By the way, where did those two go?

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:24.390
They said something about "a real woman," and
went to the kitchen to make a special meal for you.

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:26.350
A special meal?

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:30.660
What are they thinking? They should have
left to go search for the culprits already.

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:33.630
I'm sure Meshuzera is crying in her grave.

00:14:33.630 --> 00:14:34.930
I understand how you must feel.

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:52.550
If the direct approach
doesn't work with Reamonn...

00:14:56.690 --> 00:14:59.460
...then we'll have to get to
his heart through his stomach.

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:00.620
Jeez, what a pain.

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:07.200
Smells wonderful.

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:08.630
Yours, too.

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:13.100
Yup, tastes great!

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:17.910
Shake, shake, shake!

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:23.980
Okay, perfect!

00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:27.220
Shake, shake, shake, shake, shake!

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:28.980
And just to be sure, shake, shake, shake!

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:40.800
Five more points until we reach the target.

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:43.640
Right, then. Surface and charge!

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:47.210
Damn you, Dirty Pair. I'll strangle you
myself for everything you've done!

00:15:57.620 --> 00:15:59.090
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:00.920
Huh?

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:04.490
Here's some warm food,
made with lots of love!

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:06.760
Mine is way more delicious.

00:16:06.760 --> 00:16:07.820
Mine is!
Mine is!

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:09.620
Mine is, dammit!
Mine is, dammit!

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:20.900
Watch out!

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:29.740
Ah! Y-You're!

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:33.320
How I've missed you, Dirty Pair.

00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:35.790
We didn't miss you one bit.

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:38.890
You're like a cockroach that refuses to die.

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:40.660
Keep talking, keep talking.

00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:47.760
I'll never die. Not until I kill you two, that is.

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:52.940
W-What the? What's happening?

00:16:55.710 --> 00:16:56.540
Kill them!

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:07.580
Disgusting!

00:17:09.820 --> 00:17:13.060
Hey, you! Did you do something to my food?

00:17:13.060 --> 00:17:16.050
I could ask the same thing!
You're despicable. Despicable!

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:17.760
That's enough!

00:17:19.570 --> 00:17:22.770
Like we even need to get serious
against a guy like you!

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:23.500
Take this!

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:26.240
This way!

00:17:28.780 --> 00:17:30.000
You too, Reamonn! Hurry!

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:37.680
She touched me!

00:17:38.020 --> 00:17:39.540
W-What the?

00:17:59.410 --> 00:18:01.170
Bleh!

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:05.080
Forget him! After the Dirty Pair!

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:12.240
Take that!

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:18.620
Kei!

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:23.690
Dead at last.

00:18:24.900 --> 00:18:28.200
You're nothing but talk, Dirty Pair.

00:18:38.810 --> 00:18:40.470
Reamonn! Stay back!

00:18:40.780 --> 00:18:42.340
It's that guy again!

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:44.870
Reamonn?!

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:01.770
W-What happened? What have I done?

00:19:49.320 --> 00:19:51.180
Looks like it's over.

00:19:54.990 --> 00:19:56.180
Master Reamonn!

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:04.000
Don't worry. I'll make sure your
partner follows you to Hell.

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:05.160
Master Reamonn!

00:20:07.840 --> 00:20:09.300
M-Miralda!

00:20:12.670 --> 00:20:14.140
Don't! Stay back!

00:20:15.640 --> 00:20:16.670
Miralda!

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:21.410
Stay back!

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:27.380
Master Reamonn!

00:20:46.670 --> 00:20:47.770
Miralda.

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:51.440
Forgive me, I...

00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:58.050
Miralda.

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:12.290
We lost.

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:16.130
Yep. Looks like Reamonn's
allergy has been cured, too.

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:21.040
Miralda, I just learned
what true love really is,

00:21:21.040 --> 00:21:24.750
and that love healed my
body and soul in an instant.

00:21:24.750 --> 00:21:26.110
Master Reamonn...

00:21:26.110 --> 00:21:28.850
Look at the beautiful sunset.

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:34.150
If only I had the hands of the gods, I would
weave that sunset into a veil and give it to you.

00:21:35.490 --> 00:21:36.960
Look at you two!

00:21:39.830 --> 00:21:43.900
What? Your allergy is cured,
but only around Miralda?

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:48.040
It doesn't matter, because Miralda
means everything to me now.

00:21:48.040 --> 00:21:51.940
So, about that job you hired us for...

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:55.010
Sorry, but I've decided to cancel it.

00:21:55.010 --> 00:21:58.270
From now on, I'm going to
devote myself to my new love.

00:21:59.010 --> 00:22:00.350
What a line.

00:22:00.350 --> 00:22:02.510
So corny...

00:22:03.580 --> 00:22:04.810
Miralda...

00:22:05.350 --> 00:22:06.790
Master Reamonn...

00:22:10.060 --> 00:22:11.150
Smooch!
Smooch!

00:22:16.160 --> 00:22:17.560
Yeah!
Yeah!

00:22:43.220 --> 00:22:49.700
The mystery began after I fell asleep that time
Ano toki nemuri no ato ni okotta mistuerii

00:22:49.700 --> 00:22:56.200
I was guided by a voice from the future
Mirai kara kuru koe ni michibikareta no yo

00:22:56.200 --> 00:23:02.680
I passed through a distant, silvery time tunnel
Giniro haruka na taimu tonneru nukete

00:23:02.680 --> 00:23:09.310
